Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 12), dh-dkms | dkms
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: swt6621s-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, make, gcc, perl
Description: SWT6621S SDIO Wi-Fi and Bluetooth driver (DKMS)
 Source for the skw_sdio_lite, swt6621s_wifi and skwbt kernel modules.
 DKMS builds the modules for installed kernels with matching headers and
 rebuilds them when a new kernel is installed.
 .
 Matching kernel headers and board-specific firmware are required.
 Firmware is not included in this package.
